# Game sprites in the low segment ($0400-$1FFF): the aliens and the
# explosion frames.  See game.spr for the colour key and halos.

# Alien type 1: saucer (orange, white dome, blue legs)
sprite saucer artifact halo 1 2
..WWWW..
.WOWWOW.
OOOOOOOO
O.OOOO.O
OOOOOOOO
.BB..BB.
.B.BB.B.
B..BB..B
B......B
.B....B.
end

